{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q408497","formula":"Al₄Ta₃O₁₃(OH)","hill":"Al4HO14Ta3","elements":["H","O","Al","Ta"],"composition":{"H":1.0,"O":14.0,"Al":4.0,"Ta":3.0},"names":{"en":"Simpsonite","uk":"Сімпсоніт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Simpsonite has a general formula of Al4(Ta,Nb)3O13(OH). It occurs as euhedral to subhedral tabular to short and prismatic crystals, commonly in subparallel groups. Under the petrographic microscope it has a very high relief.","uk":"Сімпсоніт — мінерал з класу оксидів, має загальну формулу Al 4 ( Ta , Nb ) 3 O 13 ( OH ) {\\displaystyle {\\ce {Al4(Ta,Nb)3O13(OH)}}} . Зустрічається у формі евгедральних, субевгедральних, пластинчастих, коротких і призматичних кристалів, зазвичай у субпаралельних групах. Під петрографічним мікроскопом має дуже високий рельєф."},"fame":10,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q408497","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simpsonite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BF%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%96%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Simpsonite-154999.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q4008481","formula":"MnVAlSi₂O₆(OH)₄","names":{"en":"Vanadiocarpholite"},"elements":["H","O","Al","Si","V","Mn"],"fame":5,"kind":null},{"id":"Q3660669","formula":"MnAl₂(Si₂O₆)(OH)₄","names":{"en":"Carpholite","ru":"Карфолит"},"elements":["H","O","Al","Si","Mn"],"fame":13,"kind":null},{"id":"Q409470","formula":"Al₂Si₄O₁₀(OH)₂","names":{"en":"Pyrophyllite","ru":"Пирофиллит","uk":"Пір